#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Unmapping keeps the device, its graphs, and their history."
msgstr "取消對應會保留裝置、其圖表以及歷史資料。"

#: lib/ClustersPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The cluster is still mapped to device %d, which no longer exists. Creating or mapping a device replaces that mapping."
msgstr "叢集仍對應至已不存在的裝置 %d。建立或對應裝置將會取代該對應關係。"

#: lib/ClustersPage.php
